{"v":4,"catch":"解決所有級別","desc":"Tomb Sweeper 是一款緊張刺激的迷宮遊戲。這是一個獨特而有趣的標題，您的重點是嘗試將玩家從牆壁移動到全部或角落到角落，以創建路徑並完成關卡。一旦關卡充滿色彩，您就可以進入下一個關卡。有 100 多個級別需要通過，您將享受每一刻的樂趣，同時也測試您的技能。你有能力完成所有級別嗎？\n特徵：\n100 多個關卡等你來玩\n測試您的技能並玩得開心\n有趣的遊戲機制\n酷像素藝術","publisher":"Piotr Skalski","release":"2021-08-19","genres":["益智","街機","訓練","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59dd25673285d7aad3d00ce33a9d89c2f299b5186ca4234ffadd332fc0768d07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/579d3999ff34b722e894437a336316ddf13eaa412914ad6b18744d948cd6735b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df91d82c163464570c276398425c2df33f5e1efab9d5f3a96dba151de05b012c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b4a6e8695355bd70769314e904348630c77dd2b4063c319973bed0e9b20d0175.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ede1c0dd9b91079730af2e410f0f99dac9d719b54b36a437300d7d6d2e35f759.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/315b2858ceac9018ce64cc0ec39d9b8cd5ad4fcc2affc4adafe631e75a0ebd3e.jpg"],"titleId":"01007ee015b38000","dlc":[]}